&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.3pt;padding-right:4.8pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-22.5pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;㈱グッドライフカンパニー社外取締役&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.3pt;padding-right:4.8pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-22.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;（監査等委員）（現任）&lt;/p&gt;
